<div class="content">

      <h2>The Premise</h2>

    <p> Hopefully you're familiar with rogue (or rogue-like games)
    already.  They are text-based games which have a familiar premise
    --- wander around in a dungeon, collect treasure,
    beat up bad-tempered critters, try to finish a quest.</p>

<?php include ("playnavigation.txt") ?>

